        <summary>Stops the observation previously started using <c>AppFunctionManager#observeAppFunctions</c>
            from receiving updates.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>Stops the observation previously started using AppFunctionManager.observeAppFunctions from receiving updates.</para>
          <para>If the observation is already canceled, this method has no effect.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/appfunctions/AppFunctionObservation#cancel()" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.app.appfunctions.AppFunctionObservation.cancel</code>.</a></format></para>
